<section class="three-tool-knowledge" id="salah-deep-guide" aria-labelledby="salah-deep-heading">
<h2 id="salah-deep-heading">Daily Salah tracker: complete private five-prayer checklist guide</h2>
<p><strong>Short answer:</strong> A daily Salah tracker lets you tick the prayers you personally record on a specific date. This version can review and correct records from the past 90 days, export CSV or a JSON backup and restore an existing history. Unrecorded dates are reported as <strong>unknown</strong>, never automatically treated as missed prayers.</p>
